Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gcc, make
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: gonzod
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, util-linux, udev
Description: topology-aware system policy compiler
 gonzod discovers hardware topology and applies CPU, cgroup, storage and IRQ
 policy at lifecycle edges.  Policy is deliberately not applied by package
 installation; run gonzod enable after reviewing the local system.
